OL,3,GNEWSACommunity still in shock after
OL,4,AHalloween stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community is still processing its
OL,7,Fsadness and shock after five teenagers
OL,8,Fwere injured after being stabbed at a
OL,9,FHalloween party in Hampshire, a local
OL,10,Fchurch leader has said.
OL,12,FThe Reverend Duncan Hollands is the
OL,13,Fvicar at St Boniface Church, the parish
OL,14,Fchurch of Chandler's Ford, where the
OL,15,Fattack took place at about 22:30 GMT on
OL,16,FSaturday.
OL,18,FHe said the church would hold a service
OL,19,Fto give people in the area a chance to
OL,20,F"grieve" and "be together" in the wake
OL,21,Fof the incident.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
