OL,4,AHalloween stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Eastleigh MP, Liberal
OL,7,FDemocrat Liz Jarvis, urged the
OL,8,Fgovernment to treat violent crime as a
OL,9,F"public health emergency".
